 natural gas, and other liquid hydrocarbons. In addition, the company engages in research, development, production, transportation, distribution, and trading of energy. Petróleo Brasileiro S.A. - Petrobras was incorporated in 1953 and is headquartered in Rio De Janeiro, Brazil.","web":"https://petrobras.com.br","empleados":43199.0,"precio_bloque":{"precio":18.530000686645508,"r1m":-0.2494937105778895,"r3m":0.04056152504830579,"r6m":-0.054583723929557126,"r12m":0.59250580835014,"ytd":0.6218978464110985,"r12m_spy":0.09687826954781587,"mom12_1":1.121908677909107,"vs_ma200":-0.015862175804284284,"max52":26.15999984741211,"vs_max52":-0.29166663628713296,"vol1y":0.3894702685936203,"beta":-0.12123248339800285,"caida_max_5y":-0.35748575840893027,"serie":{"f":["2021-11-12","2021-11-19","2021-11-26","2021-12-03","2021-12-10","2021-12-17","2021-12-24","2021-12-31","2022-01-07","2022-01-14","2022-01-21","2022-01-28","2022-02-04","2022-02-11","2022-02-18","2022-02-25","2022-03-04","2022-03-11","2022-03-18","2022-03-25","2022-04-01","2022-04-08","2022-04-15","2022-04-22","2022-04-29","2022-05-06","2022-05-13","2022-05-20","2022-05-27","2022-06-03","2022-06-10","2022-06-17","2022-06-24","2022-07-01","2022-07-08","2022-07-15","2022-07-22","2022-07-29","2022-08-05","2022-08-12","2022-08-19","2022-08-26","2022-09-02","2022-09-09","2022-09-16","2022-09-23","2022-09-30","2022-10-07","2022-10-14","2022-10-21","2022-10-28","2022-11-04","2022-11-11","2022-11-18","2022-11-25","2022-12-02","2022-12-09","2022-12-16","2022-12-23","2022-12-30","2023-01-06","2023-01-13","2023-01-20","2023-01-27","2023-02-03","2023-02-10","2023-02-17","2023-02-24","2023-03-03","2023-03-10","2023-03-17","2023-03-24","2023-03-31","2023-04-07","2023-04-14","2023-04-21","2023-04-28","2023-05-05","2023-05-12","2023-05-19","2023-05-26","2023-06-02","2023-06-09","2023-06-16","2023-06-23","2023-06-30","2023-07-07","2023-07-14","2023-07-21","2023-07-28","2023-08-04","2023-08-11","2023-08-18","2023-08-25","2023-09-01","20